    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca6 <strong>Build the path \u2014 help Agent Tony reach the pool!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/0fbafff31ac700f20f0cc1d43caa2223.poster.webp?t=1751630462\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/0fbafff31ac700f20f0cc1d43caa2223.webp?t=1751630462\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span><strong></strong>\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Slide and splash \u2014 clean the pools, save the fun!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/f9686aeea5cd5fafd8837c42f91834c3.poster.webp?t=1751630462\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/f9686aeea5cd5fafd8837c42f91834c3.webp?t=1751630462\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span><strong></strong>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Find your unique path to victory!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/2dfe7bfb9793c7f1b3a3ecbd3185354c.poster.webp?t=1751630462\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/2dfe7bfb9793c7f1b3a3ecbd3185354c.webp?t=1751630462\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span><strong></strong>\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Place gadgets, master physics, and make a splash!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/f73eb1b549c6e494145698074cda25cc.poster.webp?t=1751630462\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/f73eb1b549c6e494145698074cda25cc.webp?t=1751630462\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span><strong><br>Operation: Clean Splash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splash hard. Save the fun.</strong><br>A monstrous goo is poisoning pools around the world\u2014and only adrenaline-fueled dives can purify them. In <i>Operation: Clean Splash</i>, you play as <strong>Agent Tony</strong>, a high-dive hero on a mission to restore summer joy across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your jump, place wild gadgets like trampolines, zip lines, and air vents, then dive with precision into chaotic, physics-based puzzles. Hit the water just right, charge your CleanSphere, and wash the slime away!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>What Is It?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operation: Clean Splash</strong> is a <strong>physics puzzle game</strong> filled with kinetic gadget-based challenges, colorful environments, and a light-hearted story. Set across five vibrant worlds\u2014from Rooftop City to Volcano Heights\u2014you\u2019ll experiment with movement, momentum, and mayhem to land the perfect splash.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Meets Platformer</strong><br>Use clever gadgets to bounce, launch, and glide Agent Tony into the pool in each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splash-Powered Story</strong><br>Save the world from sludge one dive at a time as part of the secret Splash Agency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gadget Variety</strong><br>Play with trampolines, fans, magnets, portals, ziplines, and more to solve each stage your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Unique Biomes</strong><br>Explore vibrant hand-crafted worlds like Jungle Falls, Snowcap Base, and Desert Mirage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay for Perfection</strong><br>Earn up to 3 stars by using fewer gadgets, hitting secret splash zones, or completing levels in fewer moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Timer Pressure</strong><br>Take your time or speedrun\u2014it\u2019s up to you. The challenge comes from creativity, not a countdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Feedback</strong><br>Enjoy screen shakes, splash effects, and satisfying success sounds every time you nail a perfect dive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whether you're a fan of creative physics puzzles, chill challenge design, or just like watching cartoon agents fly through the air\u2014<i>Operation: Clean Splash</i> will make a big splash in your game library.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca6 <strong>Build the path \u2014 help Agent Tony reach the pool!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/0fbafff31ac700f20f0cc1d43caa2223.poster.webp?t=1751630462\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/0fbafff31ac700f20f0cc1d43caa2223.webp?t=1751630462\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span><strong></strong>\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Slide and splash \u2014 clean the pools, save the fun!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/f9686aeea5cd5fafd8837c42f91834c3.poster.webp?t=1751630462\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/f9686aeea5cd5fafd8837c42f91834c3.webp?t=1751630462\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span><strong></strong>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Find your unique path to victory!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/2dfe7bfb9793c7f1b3a3ecbd3185354c.poster.webp?t=1751630462\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/2dfe7bfb9793c7f1b3a3ecbd3185354c.webp?t=1751630462\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span><strong></strong>\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Place gadgets, master physics, and make a splash!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/f73eb1b549c6e494145698074cda25cc.poster.webp?t=1751630462\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808740/extras/f73eb1b549c6e494145698074cda25cc.webp?t=1751630462\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span><strong><br>Operation: Clean Splash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splash hard. Save the fun.</strong><br>A monstrous goo is poisoning pools around the world\u2014and only adrenaline-fueled dives can purify them. In <i>Operation: Clean Splash</i>, you play as <strong>Agent Tony</strong>, a high-dive hero on a mission to restore summer joy across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your jump, place wild gadgets like trampolines, zip lines, and air vents, then dive with precision into chaotic, physics-based puzzles. Hit the water just right, charge your CleanSphere, and wash the slime away!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>What Is It?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operation: Clean Splash</strong> is a <strong>physics puzzle game</strong> filled with kinetic gadget-based challenges, colorful environments, and a light-hearted story. Set across five vibrant worlds\u2014from Rooftop City to Volcano Heights\u2014you\u2019ll experiment with movement, momentum, and mayhem to land the perfect splash.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Meets Platformer</strong><br>Use clever gadgets to bounce, launch, and glide Agent Tony into the pool in each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splash-Powered Story</strong><br>Save the world from sludge one dive at a time as part of the secret Splash Agency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gadget Variety</strong><br>Play with trampolines, fans, magnets, portals, ziplines, and more to solve each stage your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Unique Biomes</strong><br>Explore vibrant hand-crafted worlds like Jungle Falls, Snowcap Base, and Desert Mirage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay for Perfection</strong><br>Earn up to 3 stars by using fewer gadgets, hitting secret splash zones, or completing levels in fewer moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Timer Pressure</strong><br>Take your time or speedrun\u2014it\u2019s up to you. The challenge comes from creativity, not a countdown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Feedback</strong><br>Enjoy screen shakes, splash effects, and satisfying success sounds every time you nail a perfect dive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whether you're a fan of creative physics puzzles, chill challenge design, or just like watching cartoon agents fly through the air\u2014<i>Operation: Clean Splash</i> will make a big splash in your game library.</strong></p>",
